      "type": "question",
      "storyId": 1624,
      "title": "Package sticker: when the product interval is longer than the service interval, which rule wins? Story section 8 Priority Rules (product wins: 20 km/20 Day) vs Minimum Interval Rule (shortest wins: 10 km/10 Day). Blocks TC-SST-049, 050 and draft e-20261116-021",
