      "owner": "Mohammad Alshellah",
      "timestamp": "2026-11-17T22:03:22+03:00",
      "notes": "Still open: waiting for the business answer (reopened 18/11/2026 after a wrong cancel)",
      "url": null,
      "status": "answered",
      "question": {
        "answer": "Business (19/11/2026): when the item has its own data, its data is always used. Product value wins even when longer than the service. Current behaviour is correct.",
